    "steps": [
        "Beat the softened butter, sugar and brown sugar until creamy.",
        "Add the eggs and vanilla and mix until combined.",
        "Mix the flour, salt, baking powder and baking soda separately.",
        "Add the dry ingredients to the butter mixture and stir until almost combined.",
        "Add the chocolate chips and nuts and mix into a dough.",
        "Chill the dough for at least 1 hour.",
        "Heat the oven to 350°F / 175°C. Form the dough into 16–20 large balls and place them on baking trays.",
        "Bake for about 25 minutes, until the ridges begin to turn golden. Cool on the trays for 5–10 minutes, then transfer to a wire rack."
    ],
